कर्म चैव तदर्थीयं सदित्येवाभिधीयते ॥ २७ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":4418,\"bb\":3878,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/17/26-27/b3878/\",\"body_value\":\"sad-bhāve sādhu-bhāve ca
