sac-chabdaḥ pārtha yujyate\"},{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":4419,\"bb\":3879,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/17/26-27/b3879/\",\"body_value\":\"yajñe tapasi dāne ca
